<figure
  class="refund-takeover-diagram"
  aria-labelledby="refund-takeover-caption"
>
  <svg
    class="refund-takeover-diagram__desktop"
    viewBox="0 0 960 620"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="refund-takeover-title refund-takeover-desc"
  >
    <title id="refund-takeover-title">
      接管提交之後，舊 attempt 才失去寫入資格
    </title>
    <desc id="refund-takeover-desc"
      >A 取得 attempt 7 後暫停。期限到達只允許 B 嘗試接管；B 提交 attempt 8
      後，A 的舊世代更新被拒絕。B
      先核對原退款再結案；本地寫入檢查不會取消遠端已送出的請求。</desc
    >
    <text x="40" y="42" class="refund-takeover-diagram__title"
      >期限允許接管，世代決定寫入權</text
    >
    <text x="40" y="74" class="refund-takeover-diagram__detail"
      >同一 operation_key 持續不變；以下是 B 先完成接管的順序</text
    >
    <rect
      x="40"
      y="104"
      width="880"
      height="94"
      rx="12"
      class="refund-takeover-diagram__card"></rect>
    <text x="65" y="142" class="refund-takeover-diagram__number">1</text>
    <text x="108" y="139" class="refund-takeover-diagram__title"
      >A 取得 attempt 7</text
    >
    <text x="108" y="170" class="refund-takeover-diagram__detail"
      >短交易領取後才外呼；A 隨後暫停。</text
    >
    <rect
      x="40"
      y="214"
      width="880"
      height="94"
      rx="12"
      class="refund-takeover-diagram__card"></rect>
    <text x="65" y="252" class="refund-takeover-diagram__number">2</text>
    <text x="108" y="249" class="refund-takeover-diagram__title"
      >到達 lease_until</text
    >
    <text x="108" y="280" class="refund-takeover-diagram__detail"
      >B 可以競爭接管；尚未換代，A 仍可提交有效結果。</text
    >
    <rect
      x="40"
      y="324"
      width="880"
      height="94"
      rx="12"
      class="refund-takeover-diagram__card"></rect>
    <text x="65" y="362" class="refund-takeover-diagram__number">3</text>
    <text x="108" y="359" class="refund-takeover-diagram__title"
      >B 提交 attempt 8</text
    >
    <text x="108" y="390" class="refund-takeover-diagram__detail"
      >本地處理權換代。B 核對原退款，確認後再結案。</text
    >
    <rect
      x="40"
      y="434"
      width="880"
      height="94"
      rx="12"
      class="refund-takeover-diagram__card"></rect>
    <text x="65" y="472" class="refund-takeover-diagram__number">4</text>
    <text x="108" y="469" class="refund-takeover-diagram__title"
      >A 恢復，帶 attempt 7 寫回</text
    >
    <text x="108" y="500" class="refund-takeover-diagram__detail"
      >目前世代已是 8，舊完成或錯誤重排都無法轉移狀態。</text
    >
    <text x="40" y="580" class="refund-takeover-diagram__detail"
      >邊界：拒絕舊世代寫入，不會撤回已送出的遠端退款。</text
    >
  </svg>
  <div class="refund-takeover-diagram__mobile">
    <section>
      <h3>1. A 取得 attempt 7</h3><p>短交易領取後才外呼；A 隨後暫停。</p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h3>2. 到達 lease_until</h3><p>
        B 可以競爭接管；尚未換代，A 仍可提交有效結果。
      </p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h3>3. B 提交 attempt 8</h3><p>
        本地處理權換代。B 核對原退款，確認後再結案。
      </p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h3>4. A 恢復，帶 attempt 7 寫回</h3><p>
        目前世代已是 8，舊完成或錯誤重排都無法轉移狀態。
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
  <figcaption id="refund-takeover-caption">
    若 A 先完成，B
    就不能接管已結案工作。所有轉移都在同一筆工作上裁決；遠端結果另行核對。
  </figcaption>
</figure>
